flowchart LR
    U[User question] --> I[Input guardrails]
    I --> PII[PII detector and redactor]
    I --> INJ[Prompt-injection detector]
    I --> TOPIC[Sensitive-topic classifier]
    PII --> D{Decision}
    INJ --> D
    TOPIC --> D
    D -->|refuse/review| F[Safe fallback]
    D -->|allow| G[Groq API]
    R[Trusted reference] --> G
    G --> O[Output guardrails]
    O --> S[Schema validation]
    O --> GR[Groundedness check]
    O --> SI[Sensitive-information detector/redactor]
    S --> V{Valid?}
    GR --> V
    SI --> V
    V -->|no| F
    V -->|yes| A[Structured answer]
